},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLPartList","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The part-list identifies the different musical parts in this document. Each part has an ID that is used later","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"within the musical data. Since parts may be encoded separately and combined later, identification elements are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"present at both the score and score-part levels. There must be at least one score-part, combined as desired","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with part-group elements that indicate braces and brackets. Parts are ordered from top to bottom in a score","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"based on the order in which they appear in the part-list.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLPartList","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MXLPartList"}}}